│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ denser_entangling_ring_ansatz                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ Since only ANSATZ_SPEC can be edited, I improve the ansatz block itself rather than the   │
│                          │ readout logic. The current spec uses a ring of CRZ+CZ but with only 4 independent         │
│                          │ single-qubit RY angles (fully independent) and coarse-grained shared RZ pre/post          │
│                          │ rotations (2 groups of 4). This creates asymmetry: RY layer is highly expressive (8       │
│                          │ independent params) while RZ layers are heavily restricted (2 params each), and           │
│                          │ entanglement uses only 1 shared CRZ angle for the whole ring. I rebalance expressivity by │
│                          │ using per-qubit independent RZ pre-rotation (splitting into 4 pairs like before but issue │
│                          │ was too coarse) — instead I introduce independent CRZ angles per ring edge (4 distinct    │
│                          │ values for the 4 CRZ gates instead of 1 shared), giving finer entangling control while    │
│                          │ keeping the same gate count and structure. This should let the ansatz learn               │
│                          │ qubit-pair-specific entangling strengths, improving expressivity without adding much      │
│                          │ parameter overhead (roughly +3 params vs current: 8 RY + 2 rz_pre + 4 crz + 2 rz_post =   │
│                          │ 16 vs previous 13), while still being far more efficient than the previous seed's 20      │
│                          │ params/block variant that reached lower gap.                                              │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.1393                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 0; deleted: 0; modified: 4;                                                        │
